{"ID":"20240522082257-6a11b3m","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082257-6a11b3m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082257-6a11b3m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522090124-i06ffj3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522090127-nz4s4hh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:897,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522090124-xxqe614\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:15,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:72\u0026#125;","title":"毒奶粉結石案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522090208"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522090124-i06ffj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-i06ffj3","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒奶粉結石案例】"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-6pjkjua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-6pjkjua","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎8-7-2008初診"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-gmitmzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-gmitmzn","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"朱姓婦人， 56歲，剛從台灣來加州，探視寶貝兒子，看見我走進診室，即呼道：不行了，不行了，我已經忍不住了才來看你，你一要幫幫我。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-yotk5if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-yotk5if","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我答道：您別急，到底怎麼了？哪裏不舒服？"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-h9bdr3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-h9bdr3d","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的腰悶痛了近一星期，原想休息休息就好，沒想到越來越嚴重，尤其到晚上，躺下睡覺時，痛得我難以入眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-0vv5ofe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-0vv5ofe","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那裏痛？請指給我看。婦人右手作叉腰狀說：就在這裏！"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-441iwv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-441iwv6","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有受傷嗎？沒有。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-wt4xuwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-wt4xuwl","updated":"20240522090150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"轉動腰部疼痛程度會改變嗎？不會。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（應該不是骨傷科的問題了。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-thyd961","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-thyd961","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便有不舒服嗎？怪怪的，似痛非痛，而且顏色特別清淡無色。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-2x3vzxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-2x3vzxc","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"請您躺好，我為妳作一個檢查。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-wb7qabn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-wb7qabn","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下脈診：右尺部有原子筆尖大小的粒狀物頂手。餘部呈弦緊脈。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-kc2axc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-kc2axc9","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    耳診：右耳腎點（＋）耳輸尿管點（＋）耳膽囊點（－）"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-g21414i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-g21414i","updated":"20240522090153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穴位診：右腎結石點太溪至复溜之間，有四、五個很小結節。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（大概是細沙狀結石居多。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小腿膽囊點（－）"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-j2rvdm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-j2rvdm7","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹診：右季肋下近帶脈穴壓痛，臍右近盲俞穴處壓痛。膽囊點（－）"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-g5kdo2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-g5kdo2h","updated":"20240522090154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（應該可以確診是腎與輸尿管結石了，一般只要兩到三個診查系統，指向同一問題時，多半能確診無誤了。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-xxqe614","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-xxqe614","updated":"20240522090208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仿＜豬苓湯＞合＜茯苓戎鹽湯＞意"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"『倪師曰：豬苓湯就是治療腎結石的專方，茯苓戎鹽湯中之青鹽，則能震碎石頭且將大石化為小石，並與滑石一起將結石沖出。』"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-kgpn9oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-kgpn9oy","updated":"20240522090158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我開立處方：【科中豬苓湯4g，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（婦人小便淡白）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加炮附1g，另加一小藥匙青鹽】每日三次，飯前空腹，溫水調服。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-v0lfa3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-v0lfa3w","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎8-9-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-wyp1olt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-wyp1olt","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得知婦人第一天夜晚即能安睡，第二天小便時，有沙狀細碎之物排出，自此，腰際不舒，宛然若失，直稱中醫效果驚人，何須忍受超音波碎石，或手術之苦？"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-imkpf0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-imkpf0i","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接著，我詢問其生活細節，有無常期服用鈣片加維他命C，或飲用水不潔，或、、、、、、等習慣，但都問不出問題癥結所在。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-o7ulvht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-o7ulvht","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直到連日毒奶粉結石報導，才讓她恍然大悟，原來她最近連續喝了某知名品牌，四、五十包的三合一即溶咖啡。直呼：天啊！我也成了受害者！"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-wygafz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-wygafz3","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪師所傳之經方，療效絕不因時空改變而有所減損，反而能不變而應萬變，無論病名，不管原因何來(即使是人造化學毒物)，有是證，則有是方。希望毒奶粉的受害者，都能知道經方對此種病，不僅能完善治療，更能事先預防。即便是科學中藥，單方＜豬苓湯＞已能勝任了。　"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-189u7c0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-189u7c0","updated":"20240522090146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"學生孟超報告到此9-22-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522090146-17h9q94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090146-17h9q94"}},{"ID":"20240522090124-4emdwsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-4emdwsz","updated":"20240522090134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孟超處理的非常專業，一般中醫師可能連個腎結石都無法確診，更遑論如何治療了，病人遇到這種緊急狀況，也只有經方可以幫助她們立渡難關，我最恨許多西醫栽贓中醫說中醫的處方都是尚未經過驗證的，這句話最爛，最不要臉，不知是從什麼時候開始，中醫處方沒有經過驗證過? 我們使用的經方都已經至少應用過一千八百年已上，這是人盡皆知的歷史，現在居然還有這些混蛋沒讀過歷史的西醫師，說出這種沒有知識又沒有常識的話來打擊中醫，真是壞，請支持經方的民眾跟我檢舉，你只要告訴我有哪些西醫在私底下打擊中醫的，請將這些爛醫師的名字跟我說，讓我來修理修理這些笨蛋，讓這些人遺臭萬年。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-l8w12gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-l8w12gg","updated":"20240522090203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"   上篇中的婦人還不知道牛奶跟咖啡都是給敵人吃的，自己千萬不要再喝了，就算是無毒的牛奶，也不可以喝的，因為會餵食腫瘤，讓腫瘤長得更快更大。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-mnmx727","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-mnmx727","updated":"20240522090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈謹記於佛州09/23/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522090124-n3gdsu3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522090124-n3gdsu3"}},{"ID":"20240522090127-nz4s4hh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090127-nz4s4hh"}}]}